<<else>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Stagnant dish water ponds in your clogged sink with traces of red. Not the first time. You get what you pay for.][/nomarkup] #line:0f4b5be
<<endif>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Maybe by some stroke of luck you will be able to convince your landlord to fix it. Or you can try to do it yourself.][/nomarkup]
-> [nomarkup][Repair it yourself.] (Resolve + Craft) [/nomarkup] #line:052c893
    <<CompleteObjective "Q_0P_FIX_SINK" "REPAIR_SINK">>
    <<GiveItem "IT_Q_BATHROOM_KEY">>  
    <<if Roll("Resolve","Craft") >= (5 - $strangeInsightModifier)>>
        <<set $police to true>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][As you open up the U-Pipe, red bile pours out.. You should be disgusted, but you find yourself transfixed by the fluid. You have to put in quite a bit of effort to refocus on the task at hand.][/nomarkup] #success #line:0c0b51c
    <<else>>
        <<set $coveredinblood to true>>
        <<set $police to true>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The pipe breaks at your touch. You are soaked in red bile. You should be disgusted, but you find yourself transfixed by the fluid. You get distracted from the sink and find yourself licking the sludge off your fingers. The taste is foul but satisfying.][/nomarkup] #failure #line:04f3ed7
    <<endif>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You found the source of the clog at least, the bathroom key and an... eyeball?][/nomarkup] #line:05f01af
